# Purpose: Compare requested and installed package arrays and report the tools that must be added before deployment.
# Inputs: build/dependencies.json: requested and installed package-name arrays.
# Outputs: reports/missing-dependencies.txt: one missing package per line; stdout echoes the report.
accept dependencies_path as text with default "build/dependencies.json"
run mkdir with flags ["-p"] and paths ["reports"]
run cat with path dependencies_path
pipe to jq with flags ["-r"] and filter "(.requested - .installed)[]"
then save to "reports/missing-dependencies.txt"
